{"page":{"id":"88fbb79b-f89c-4ff6-96b7-a04f3963cda2","theme":"one-piece","slug":"/one-piece","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/one-piece","title":"One Piece","meta_title":"One Piece (One Piece) — Work, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"One Piece is the name the world gave to all the treasure gained by the Pirate King Gol D. Roger. At least a portion of it once belonged to Joy Boy 800 years…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        One Piece is the name the world gave to all the treasure gained by the Pirate King <a href=\"/one-piece/gol-d-roger\" class=\"entity-link\">Gol D. Roger</a>. At least a portion of it once belonged to <a href=\"/one-piece/joy-boy\" class=\"entity-link\">Joy Boy</a> 800 years ago, during the <a href=\"/one-piece/void-century\" class=\"entity-link\">Void Century</a>. The treasure is said to be of…\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/poneglyphs\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Poneglyphs</strong></a>, <a href=\"/one-piece/laugh-tale\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Laugh Tale</strong></a>, <a href=\"/one-piece/straw-hat-pirates/monkey-d-luffy\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Monkey D. Luffy</strong></a>, <a href=\"/one-piece/eiichiro-oda\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Eiichiro Oda</strong></a>, <a href=\"/one-piece/grand-line\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Grand Line</strong></a> and <a href=\"/one-piece/one-piece-mystery\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Mystery of One Piece</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"overview format-hubs\">\n    <h2>Explore by medium</h2>\n    <p>\n        Open the format-specific shelves — movies, games, manga, shows, and more —\n        each with their own long-tail pages.\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"format-hub-list\">\n        <li><a href=\"/one-piece/manga\" class=\"entity-link\">One Piece Mang