\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/one-piece/grand-line\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Grand Line</strong>\n                    <span>The Grand Line is an ocean route which wraps around the entire Blue Planet, south of the North and East Blues and north of the South and West Blues. It is separated from the Blues on both the north and south ends by the…</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/poneglyphs\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Poneglyphs\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The One Piece mystery is inseparable from the Poneglyphs and lost history.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/laugh-tale\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Laugh Tale\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Laugh Tale is the destination where Roger&#039;s crew reached the end of the journey.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/grand-line\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Grand Line\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The search for One Piece takes place across the Grand Line.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/one-piece-mystery\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            The Mystery of One Piece\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The identity and meaning of the One Piece form the central mystery.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/void-century\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Void Century\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The ultimate mystery of One Piece is connected to the lost history of the world.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/joy-boy\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Joy Boy\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Joy Boy&#039;s legacy is deeply connected to the central mystery of One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/joy-boy\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Joy Boy\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Joy Boy is one of the deepest historical connections to One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Adapted Into</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">2</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Adapted Into\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/anime/one-piece-anime\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            One Piece Anime\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The manga was adapted into the One Piece television anime.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Adapted Into\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/live-action/one-piece-live-action\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            One Piece Live-Action\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The manga was adapted into a live-action television series.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Adaptation Of</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">2</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Adaptation Of\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/live-action/one-piece-live-action\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            One Piece Live-Action\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The live-action series is adapted from One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Adaptation Of\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/anime/one-piece-anime\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            One Piece Anime\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The television anime is adapted from the manga.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Sought By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Sought By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/straw-hat-pirates/monkey-d-luffy\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Monkey D. Luffy\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Luffy seeks the One Piece treasure.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Created By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Created By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/eiichiro-oda\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Eiichiro Oda\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Eiichiro Oda created One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Found By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Found By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/gol-d-roger\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Gol D. Roger\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Roger&#039;s crew discovered the truth surrounding One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Motivates</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Motivates\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/great-pirate-era\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Great Pirate Era\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The search for One Piece drives the Great Pirate Era.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Contained By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Contained By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/laugh-tale\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Laugh Tale\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Laugh Tale is directly connected to the final mystery of One Piece.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Preceded By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Preceded By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/manga/romance-dawn\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Romance Dawn\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Romance Dawn preceded the serialized One Piece story.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>The One Piece mystery is inseparable from the Poneglyphs and lost history.</li><li>Laugh Tale is the destination where Roger&#039;s crew reached the end of the journey.</li><li>Luffy seeks the One Piece treasure.</li><li>Eiichiro Oda created One Piece.</li><li>Evidence around One Piece is classified as documented on Ton-o-Lore.</li><li>One Piece currently maps to 60 linked entities inside One Piece.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sources\">\n    <h2>Sources &amp; further reading</h2>\n    <p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a></p>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is One Piece?</h2>\n\n    <p>\n        <strong>One Piece</strong> is a Japanese manga series written and\n        illustrated by <a href=\"/one-piece/eiichiro-oda\" class=\"entity-link\">Eiichiro Oda</a>.\n        It began serialization in\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/weekly-shonen-jump\" class=\"entity-link\">Weekly Shonen Jump</a>\n        in 1997, later expanding into a long-running television anime produced by\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/toei-animation\" class=\"entity-link\">Toei Animation</a>\n        and a live-action adaptation.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        The story follows\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/straw-hat-pirates/monkey-d-luffy\" class=\"entity-link\">Monkey D. Luffy</a>,\n        a young pirate whose dream is to become the Pirate King. Luffy sets\n        out to find the legendary treasure called <strong>One Piece</strong>,\n        assembling the\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/straw-hat-pirates\" class=\"entity-link\">Straw Hat Pirates</a>\n        along the way.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        That search opens into a much larger web —\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/gol-d-roger\" class=\"entity-link\">Gol D. Roger</a>,\n        the <a href=\"/one-piece/void-century\" class=\"entity-link\">Void Century</a>,\n        the <a href=\"/one-piece/poneglyphs\" class=\"entity-link\">Poneglyphs</a>,\n        <a href=\"/one-piece/joy-boy\" class=\"entity-link\">Joy Boy</a>,\n        and the <a href=\"/one-piece/world-government\" class=\"entity-link\">World Government</a>.\n    </p>\n</section>","word_count":1125,"uniqueness_score":"1.0000"},"entity":{"id":"9b8698db-294c-4fd5-9c48-42c8abd2340c","name":"One Piece","slug":"one-piece","type":"work","kind":"work","type_label":"Work","short_description":"One Piece is the name the world gave to all the treasure gained by the Pirate King Gol D. Roger. At least a portion of it once belonged to Joy Boy 800 years ago, during the Void Century. The treasure is said to be of…","description":"One Piece is the name the world gave to all the treasure gained by the Pirate King Gol D. Roger. At least a portion of it once belonged to Joy Boy 800 years ago, during the Void Century. The treasure is said to be of unimaginable value, and is supposedly located on Laugh Tale, the final island of the Grand Line.\n\nThe One Piece is the driving goal of Monkey D. Luffy and his crew, as well as many other pirates, all seeking to claim the treasure in order to become the next Pirate King, following Roger's final words at his world-changing execution.\n\nAt some point during the Void Century, a man called 'Joy Boy' came across an island at the very end of the Grand Line (beyond even Lodestar, the last island reachable by conventional Log Poses). Here, he left behind a treasure of unimaginable value. Stories of this treasure on the final island piqued the interest of Gol D. Roger, and he took the World Government forbidding exploration of the island as evidence of it being real.\n\nOnly the members of the Roger Pirates crew that journeyed to the island learned what exactly the treasure consists of. Upon arriving on the island and seeing Joy Boy's treasure, the Roger Pirates simply began to laugh. Roger described it as a \"tale full of laughs,\" which gave him the idea to name the final island \"Laugh Tale.\" Sometime after the Roger Pirates' discovery, the world at large would begin to refer to Roger's treasures as the \"One Piece.\"","evidence":"documented","universe":"one-piece","aliases":["One Piece"],"wikipedia_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece","image_url":null,"image_source":null,"image_credit":null,"image_license":null,"image_usage":null,"image_alt":null},"connections":[],"rabbit_holes":[],"copyright":{"theme":"one-piece","title":"ONE PIECE is not owned by Ton-o-Lore.","body":"ONE PIECE, its characters, artwork, logos, and related intellectual property are the property of their respective rights holders, including Eiichiro Oda, Shueisha, Toei Animation, and other credited rights holders. Ton-o-Lore is an independent, unofficial fan and informational project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the ONE PIECE rights holders. Identification thumbnails, when shown, are low-resolution images used under a fair-use rationale for commentary and identification only — not free or redistributable artwork."},"subject":{"id":"one-piece","name":"One Piece","theme":"one-piece","path":"/one-piece","logo":{"license":"fair_use","usage":"fair_use_identification","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/One_piece_logo.svg/500px-One_piece_logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"ONE PIECE logo","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:One_piece_logo.svg","credit":"Fair-use identification logo via Wikimedia Commons. © Eiichiro Oda / Shueisha / Toei Animation."},"categories":["comics","anime","television","card-games"]}}